WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.239 --> 00:00:13.700
place is going to blow up!"

2
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.701
Roxy cried.

3
00:00:14.721 --> 00:00:16.542
"We have to get out of here!"

4
00:00:17.162 --> 00:00:18.103
Terrell looked around.

5
00:00:18.123 --> 00:00:19.584
"Where's Bippo?"

6
00:00:20.244 --> 00:00:23.166
Cozlin dashed all around the room, looking for the tiny robot.

7
00:00:23.186 --> 00:00:25.148
"I don't see him.

8
00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:26.969
Maybe he flew out of here."

9
00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:28.370
Wukong shrugged.

10
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.152
"He was probably scared of that big robot."

11
00:00:31.816 --> 00:00:34.137
Just then they heard shouts from the stadium crowd.

12
00:00:34.677 --> 00:00:36.357
It sounded like everyone was arguing.

13
00:00:36.377 --> 00:00:41.179
"There's no way that huge crowd can evacuate quickly," Roxy said.

14
00:00:41.199 --> 00:00:42.599
"We need to help."

15
00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.701
They hurried back into the arena, where fighters and audience members were scrambling to leave.

16
00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.022
Roxy held up her arms.

17
00:00:52.042 --> 00:00:54.823
"Everyone, please stay calm!

18
00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:59.604
We need to leave in a safe Suddenly a portal opened up in the middle of the arena.

19
00:01:00.156 --> 00:01:04.300
Roxy gasped as the Battle Master stumbled through it, and Bippo appeared.

20
00:01:04.861 --> 00:01:06.502
Everyone stopped running and arguing.

21
00:01:07.223 --> 00:01:08.384
Roxy scratched her head.

22
00:01:08.404 --> 00:01:09.725
"What just happened?"

23
00:01:10.366 --> 00:01:11.247
Terrell smiled.

24
00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.309
"Bippo has a portal projector.

25
00:01:13.729 --> 00:01:15.951
He must have followed Plurf and brought him back!"

26
00:01:16.412 --> 00:01:17.273
Bippo flew over.

27
00:01:17.293 --> 00:01:19.495
"Sneaky, me!"

28
00:01:20.315 --> 00:01:23.158
Plurf stood up and looked at all the angry faces.

29
00:01:26.112 --> 00:01:28.994
"I—I was, um, just kidding!

30
00:01:30.114 --> 00:01:32.516
This place isn't going to blow up!"

31
00:01:33.096 --> 00:01:34.117
He laughed nervously.

32
00:01:34.137 --> 00:01:36.658
"We're all safe!"

33
00:01:37.618 --> 00:01:39.880
Slowly the audience began to stomp and chant.

34
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:41.861
"Give our money back!

35
00:01:42.181 --> 00:01:45.022
Give our money back!"

36
00:01:45.182 --> 00:01:48.904
"I d-don't have your money anymore," Plurf said.

37
00:01:48.924 --> 00:01:55.468
"But if you give me some time, maybe I can, um "Give our money back!

38
00:01:55.628 --> 00:01:57.390
Give our money back!"

39
00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.111
Cozlin looked at Roxy.

40
00:01:59.131 --> 00:02:02.494
"I think this is a pretty good punishment, right?"

41
00:02:03.174 --> 00:02:03.875
Roxy nodded.

42
00:02:04.415 --> 00:02:05.556
"Let's get out of here."

43
00:02:09.219 --> 00:02:10.380
Mom," Roxy said.

44
00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.701
"We're all safe.

45
00:02:12.062 --> 00:02:13.543
Terrell and I will be home soon."

46
00:02:14.383 --> 00:02:15.244
Everyone was in Dr.

47
00:02:15.324 --> 00:02:15.805
Odd's moon.

48
00:02:16.245 --> 00:02:20.108
He, Cozlin, Terrell, and Wukong drank tea while Sapphire slept.

49
00:02:20.989 --> 00:02:24.592
As Roxy closed her watch, light sparkled and Guanyin appeared.

50
00:02:25.832 --> 00:02:26.633
Wukong bowed.

51
00:02:26.653 --> 00:02:28.153
"Hey, Bodhisattva!

52
00:02:28.574 --> 00:02:30.575
I was just about to return to the Tang Monk.

53
00:02:31.075 --> 00:02:32.456
I'm sure he misses me!"

54
00:02:33.216 --> 00:02:34.137
Guanyin smiled.

55
00:02:34.797 --> 00:02:36.798
"I will take you there now, Wukong."

56
00:02:37.419 --> 00:02:38.359
She turned to Sapphire.

57
00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:40.441
"Dragon, wake up!"

58
00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:44.223
Sapphire's eyes popped open.

59
00:02:44.983 --> 00:02:46.604
Right away, the dragon lowered her head.

60
00:02:46.624 --> 00:02:53.048
"Bodhisattva." "You performed your task well for many years," Guanyin said.

61
00:02:53.576 --> 00:02:56.237
"Buddha is pleased, so your punishment is over.

62
00:02:56.877 --> 00:02:59.578
You may now live in the Western Paradise with him."

63
00:03:00.078 --> 00:03:00.858
Sapphire nodded.

64
00:03:00.878 --> 00:03:02.178
"Thank you."

65
00:03:04.079 --> 00:03:05.339
Wukong looked at his friends.

66
00:03:05.879 --> 00:03:09.080
"Well, I guess this is good-bye—again."

67
00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:10.521
Roxy chuckled.

68
00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:13.942
"I'm sure we'll see each other sometime."

69
00:03:14.582 --> 00:03:21.464
Everyone said good-bye, and then Wukong, Guanyin, and Sapphire vanished.

70
00:03:21.504 --> 00:03:22.984
Dr. Odd sat down at his computer.

71
00:03:23.528 --> 00:03:24.509
"Let's go home."

72
00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:26.050
Cozlin sighed.

73
00:03:27.131 --> 00:03:31.175
"Yes. I have a big mess to clean up on Delkor."

74
00:03:31.935 --> 00:03:33.016
Terrell looked concerned.

75
00:03:33.036 --> 00:03:34.758
"Why don't we come with you?

76
00:03:35.258 --> 00:03:35.838
We can help."

77
00:03:36.379 --> 00:03:37.079
He looked around.

78
00:03:37.099 --> 00:03:38.881
"Right?" Dr.

79
00:03:38.961 --> 00:03:39.481
Odd nodded.

80
00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:40.602
"Of course.

81
00:03:41.203 --> 00:03:44.085
I'll be happy to visit Delkor and help with the cleanup."

82
00:03:44.866 --> 00:03:46.507
Cozlin looked at Roxy and frowned.

83
00:03:46.527 --> 00:03:48.049
"No, thanks.

84
00:03:48.549 --> 00:03:51.832
I caused a lot of trouble—I should fix it myself."

85
00:03:52.672 --> 00:03:55.113
Roxy put her arm around Cozlin's shoulders.

86
00:03:55.133 --> 00:04:00.816
"Kid Comet, do you really think we're going to make you clean up that mess by yourself?"

87
00:04:01.336 --> 00:04:02.116
Cozlin blinked.

88
00:04:02.136 --> 00:04:03.717
"You'll help me?"

89
00:04:04.597 --> 00:04:05.378
Roxy laughed.

90
00:04:05.398 --> 00:04:08.039
"Of course we'll help you.

91
00:04:08.499 --> 00:04:10.540
We're the Galaxy Squad!"
